{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2019-10-23 22:30:00', 'title': 'ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 1,825.2 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 1,778.5 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 126.1 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 127.6 MILLION A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.66 COMPARED TO USD 0.68 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 5,473.6 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 5,276.6 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 570.3 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 516.2 MILLION A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 3.01 COMPARED TO USD 2.78 A YEAR AGO.'}